    <briefdescription>
<para>A pass for printing the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_phi_values" kindref="compound">PhiValues</ref> for a function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This pass doesn&apos;t print whatever information the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_phi_values" kindref="compound">PhiValues</ref> happens to hold, but instead first uses the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_phi_values" kindref="compound">PhiValues</ref> to analyze all the phis in the function so the complete information is printed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
